Elkulator patch 06: -autoboot / -autotype / -autodelay
  -autoboot        SHIFT+BREAK shortly after power on (boots DFS/ADFS discs)
  -autotype text   types text once the Electron has started;
                   \n (backslash n) or | is RETURN, e.g. -autotype 'CHAIN""\n'
  -autodelay n     frames (1/50 s) to wait before typing (default 50)
Keys go straight into the emulated keyboard matrix, so typing does not
depend on the PC keyboard layout, window focus or key_define remapping.

